WEBVTT

00:02:57.407 --> 00:03:00.348
The mechanism that drives it has nine motors

00:03:00.348 --> 00:03:02.870
and about 3,000 pulleys.

00:03:12.516 --> 00:03:17.173
Four hundred and forty-five strings in a three-dimensional weave.

00:03:17.173 --> 00:03:20.012
Transferred to a larger scale --

00:03:20.012 --> 00:03:23.090
actually a lot larger, with a lot of help --

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:26.857
14,064 bicycle reflectors --

00:03:26.857 --> 00:03:30.606
a 20-day install.